# Note: per-user runtime caches live OUTSIDE this repo at
#   ~/.cache/cup-cli/buffer/        (post-commit retry buffer)
#   ~/.config/clickup-tracker/      (gateway config + per-project hook secrets)
# They are user-scoped, not repo-scoped — nothing to ignore here.
